# Dispatch-Smoke des U8001-Kontexts (S5): jedes neue Kommando einmal, mit EM256.
tool:    k1520dbg
run:     --em em256 -x %CLI_DIR%/scripts/u8000_smoke.dbg
timeout: 120
exit:    0
forbid:  unknown command
forbid:  kein EM
expect:  CPU-Kontext: U8001
expect:  U8001 PC=<<0>>%0000
expect:  EM EM256 (U8001, 256 KB) an MODADR A8H
expect:  <<0>>%0100: 2100 1234                 LD R0,#%1234
expect:  <<0>>%0104: A900                      INC R0,#1
expect:  <<0>>%0200    : 1234 56FF
expect:  U8001 R3 := %BEEF
expect:  "cpu":"u8001"
expect:  U8001 laeuft nicht: RESET16
expect:  bp U8001 @<<0>>%0104
expect:  U8001 breakpoints:
expect:  "u8001_pc":"<<0>>%0000"
expect:  U8001: (no samples)
# S5b
expect:  bp U8001 @<<0>>%0104 if (R3==%BEEF) & ([<<0>>%0200]w==%1234) & (C==0)
expect:  logpoint U8001 @<<0>>%0104 exprs: R3 RR4 [<<0>>%0200]l FCW PCSEG A33 MODE
expect:  [16:0] watch-write [<<0>>%0200..<<0>>%020F]  (logisch: U8001)
expect:  [16:2] watch-rw [<<0>>%0400..<<0>>%0400] == 12  (logisch: U8001)
expect:  [16:3] break-write [em:00200..em:00200] changed  (roh: U8001 und U880)
expect:  [16:4] break-read [em:00300..em:00303]  (roh: U8001 und U880)
expect:  removed 1 U8001-watch(es) covering em:00300
expect:  U8001 io-break: %0081
expect:  events: u8001-vi/nvi u8001-nmi u8001-iret
expect:  disp[1] = RH1+[<<0>>%0200]  (U8001)
expect:  <<0>>%0100 START
expect:  <<0>>%0100 <START>: 2100 1234                 LD R0,#%1234
expect:  <<0>>%0100    : 8448 4660
expect:  nicht auf em:
expect:  8 Bytes @<<0>>%0100, 8 identisch (100.0 %), 0 Abweichung(en)
expect:  8 Bytes @em:00210, 8 identisch (100.0 %), 0 Abweichung(en)
expect:  8 Bytes @<<0>>%0100, 7 identisch (87.5 %), 1 Abweichung(en):
expect:  U8001: R5 5678→0505
expect:  EM-DRAM em:00300..em:00300 (1 B)
expect:  A46 (Paritaets-FF, Merker)=0
expect:  A53 (Einzelbefehlszaehler)=11 (Vorlast 11)
forbid:  nicht auswertbar
forbid:  ? Adresse
forbid:  ? Bereich
